  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stepped‑up enforcement actions (inspections, seizures, interdictions) raise the probability of escalation and sudden trade disruptions, prompting rapid repositioning and higher realized volatility in Treasury and related markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_maritime_pressure</data>
  <data key="d39">treasury_market_stress</data>
