  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened commodity and financial volatility tied to the conflict increases investor risk aversion and liquidity constraints, producing a measurable short-term pullback in venture and institutional funding into AI startups and projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
