  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher reciprocal retaliation broadens and prolongs trade disruptions and import-price pass-through, lifting inflation expectations and risk/term premia and thereby putting upward pressure on long-term sovereign bond yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_canada_tariff_row</data>
  <data key="d39">treasury_market_stress</data>
