  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A material rise in long-term sovereign yields increases governments' near-term debt-service costs and borrowing needs, squeezing fiscal space and prompting delays, scaling back, or re-prioritization of planned military and financial assistance to Ukraine.</data>
