  <data key="d36">Sustained rises in long-term sovereign yields raise financing costs and reduce export competitiveness for interest‑sensitive industries, prompting policymakers to raise applied tariff rates to shield affected domestic producers or to generate revenue to offset higher borrowing costs.</data>
