  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A demonstrable improvement in perceived fiscal credibility eases fears of fiscal collapse and reduces calls for protective, revenue‑raising trade measures, thereby lowering domestic political pressure to pursue tariffs against the bilateral partner.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">treasury_market_stress</data>
