<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::compute_capacity" target="us_canada_tariff_row::import_dependence_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">An expansion of US aggregate AI compute (more domestic datacenter and accelerator supply) directly substitutes for imported compute services and specialized hardware from Canadian providers, reducing the bilateral share of critical compute-related imports.</data>
