  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge of US investment into AI creates new domestic corporate and investor constituencies that quickly lobby policymakers for protective trade measures against foreign competitors, increasing domestic political pressure to take tariff or barrier actions in the US–Canada relationship.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">us_canada_tariff_row</data>
